{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-19", "prepared_on": "2026-10-19", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-19</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Microsoft unveils frontier model MAI-Base-2, using one quarter of the compute of rivals<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟公布尖端模型MAI-Base-2，算力耗用是競爭模型的1/4</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft announced its in-house frontier model MAI-Base-2, claiming it beats OpenAI's mainstream models on several core benchmarks. It reportedly needs only a quarter of the compute for both training and inference.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟上週公布自行開發的MAI-Base-2，號稱在多項核心效能與基準測試上超越OpenAI主流模型，推論與訓練的算力僅需對手的1/4。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179763\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Meta and Apple bring Muse to run on Mac<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta、蘋果合作將Muse帶到Mac電腦上執行</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta launched a Mac version of the Muse app and opened the weights of its multimodal model Muse Spark Open. Working with Apple, it lets the model run on Mac Studio.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta推出Mac版Muse App，並開放多模態模型Muse Spark Open的權重，同時與蘋果合作，讓它能在Mac Studio上執行。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179764\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Anthropic commits 5% of its shares to a 'public benefit fund'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 宣布將5%股份投入「公益基金」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic said it will commit 5% of its shares to a public benefit fund.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic表示，將把5%的股份投入一個公益基金。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/18/anthropic-says-its-committing-5-of-its-shares-to-a-public-benefit-fund/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Anthropic gives outside AI watchdog \"employee-like\" access<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 給予外部AI監督機構「類員工」存取權限</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The outside watchdog can publish its findings without Anthropic's approval.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這個外部監督機構可在未經Anthropic核准的情況下，自行發布調查結果。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/anthropic-gives-outside-ai-watchdog-employee-like-access/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Replit makes OpenAI its default over Anthropic, CEO says<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Replit執行長：預設模型由Anthropic改為OpenAI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Replit CEO Masad clarified that OpenAI will replace Anthropic as the default model provider. Claude will still be available to customers on the platform.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Replit執行長Masad澄清，OpenAI將取代Anthropic成為預設模型供應商，客戶仍可在平台上使用Claude。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/17/replit-is-no-longer-working-with-anthropic-ceo-says/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Disney agrees to hire the majority of Character.AI's workforce<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">迪士尼同意聘用Character.AI多數員工</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The filing says the \"vast majority\" of Character.AI employees offered jobs at Disney accepted. It is a stalking horse bid, so another company could still come forward with a higher offer.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">文件指出，獲迪士尼錄用的Character.AI員工「絕大多數」已接受。這是「先導出價」，其他公司仍可能提出更高報價。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/18/disney-agrees-to-hire-the-majority-of-character-ais-workforce/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Google exposes China-linked hackers exploiting BeyondTrust zero-day to breach corporate networks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google揭露中國相關駭客利用BeyondTrust零時差漏洞入侵企業內網</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's GTIG and Mandiant said the suspected China-linked espionage group ARMORY CASTLE exploited the BeyondTrust Remote Support zero-day CVE-2026-102764 to compromise remote support appliances. They then accessed internal enterprise systems.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">GTIG與Mandiant揭露，疑似與中國有關的間諜組織ARMORY CASTLE利用BeyondTrust Remote Support零時差漏洞CVE-2026-102764入侵遠端支援設備，進而存取企業內部系統。CISA已將該漏洞列入KEV。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179742\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Proofpoint to acquire Varonis for $6.3 billion, expanding data and AI security<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Proofpoint以63億美元併購Varonis，擴大資料與AI安全業務</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Proofpoint announced on October 15 an all-cash deal to acquire data security firm Varonis for about $6.3 billion. The deal is expected to close in the first half of 2027.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Proofpoint於10月15日宣布，將以約63億美元全現金併購資料安全業者Varonis，預計2027年上半年完成。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179755\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> G7 to hold AI-enabled cyberattack drill to test financial sector response<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">G7將舉行AI網路攻擊演練，檢驗金融業應變能力</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The G7 plans a tabletop exercise simulating an AI-assisted cyberattack on the financial system, testing finance ministries and central banks. Japan's finance minister said ministers have agreed to the plan, and results will be used to revise response playbooks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">G7計畫舉行桌上演練，模擬金融體系遭AI輔助的網路攻擊，檢驗各國財政部門與央行的應變能力。日本財務大臣表示已獲部長層級同意，並將依結果修訂應變手冊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179758\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> OpenBSD patches 37-year-old memory bug as researchers release root exploit<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenBSD修補源自37年前的記憶體漏洞，研究人員已公開取得root權限的攻擊程式</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security firm Calif disclosed on October 16 chainable kernel flaws in OpenBSD that trace back to 1988 BSD code. This follows Anthropic's Claude Mythos Preview finding a 27-year-old remote crash bug in OpenBSD in April.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安業者Calif於10月16日揭露OpenBSD可串連利用的核心漏洞，最早可追溯至1988年的BSD原始碼。今年4月Anthropic的Claude Mythos Preview也曾在OpenBSD發現隱藏27年的遠端當機漏洞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179765\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}